    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43060" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσω</span></b> , Adv. related to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς</span> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς</span>
		to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσω</span> (qq. v.): 
			Comp.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσωτέρω τῆς Ἑλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.66
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐσωτάτω τῆς μασχάλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oss.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Corn.
				<u>ND</u>
				28
			</span></i>.</div>
